# One of the wave. 14x14 at 2x, matching Enemy.Size exactly so the hitbox and
# the drawing are the same rectangle.
#
# foe-* is the one hue neither the grass nor the towers use, which is what
# makes an enemy on the road and an enemy on the grass equally visible — and it
# is always on the road, which is the brown one.
name towerdefense-enemy
size 14 14
key o outline
key F foe-0
key f foe-1
key H foe-2-hilite
pixels
..............
...oooooo.....
..oFFFFFFo....
.oFFffffFFo...
oFofffffffooFo
*2 .oFffHHfffo...
.oFfffffffo...
.oFFffffFFo...
..oFFFFFFo....
...oooooo.....
*3 ..............
